{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Keep suspension and retry handoff bounded.** `invokeHandler()` must fully return before the already-selected outcome is read, so a blocking handler `finally` can prevent an acknowledged `PENDING` or `RETRYING` outcome from ever reaching Lambda. Bound cleanup using the invocation\u2019s remaining time with room for finalization and response delivery, then force an invocation retry if cleanup cannot finish; add a non-returning-`finally` regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QAM2","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"f821ae67a0122e7082f92ba2fb1d1c4d396ed8239bb4353959ea0e58db635a1c","observation_id":"aro_v1_7aq24z5acixhbaxzforpwhi4ju","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ujohmip6mlep7p7lfksixhq4vk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"00c12717417954984b3c3dea73b86b1cbb241039","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_w62rxgyhmwea4onlstrilt73qo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
